      "content": "SP 90 SW              CHARTRIDGE              CHARTRIDGE                                               (north side) 5/30                                          Barn to west of                                               Chartridge Green House - GV                                            II Barn dated 1723 on post.  Timber framed on brick plinth, black weather- boarding, old tiled roof.  Projecting gabled cart entry on west side flanked by outshots.  Modern garage doors.  Interior: three bays, straight braces to tiebeams, raking queenposts to purlins. Listing NGR: SP9306203823"
